    <!--
      The drawing writes «со весом» (`#s-list`, the type frame). That is a typo — the preposition
      takes the bare form before «вес» — and a typo is not a string decision, so this is the one
      character where the transcription deliberately departs from the contract. Recorded in the
      delta mapping rather than fixed silently.
    -->
