    <!--
      §26 "List states reached by an action" — PROPOSED, drawn in `#s-empty`, awaiting the device
      pass. Neither block takes a glyph: the tile is the discriminator between "empty by itself"
      and "you arrived here by an action you can undo". Filtered-to-empty has no supporting
      sentence because the filter is OR, so "remove a tag" cannot recover and there is no honest
      instruction to put in the slot.
    -->
    <string name="feature_all_exercises_filtered_empty_headline">По этим тегам ничего нет</string>
    <string name="feature_all_exercises_filtered_empty_clear">Сбросить фильтр</string>
